    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82292" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περίστροφ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>turning round : turning in
				a socket</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοτύλαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>SD</u>
					2.12
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst., <i>twisted rope</i>, 
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιδρόμους</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				2.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περίστροφος: ὁ τῆς ὑποσφραγῖδος
			τόπος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i></div>
